// Every string Sabi says, by screen and key, in Pidgin. One file, so the team can read and fix the
// voice in one place. In the real app this becomes web/src/copy/pidgin.ts with the same keys.
//
// Rules for this file:
//  - Friendly and funny, but FACTS ARE EXACT: dates, times, places, counts and statuses are never joked
//    with. The joke is in the wrapper ("No class today. Rest small, king."), not in the fact.
//  - A notice's own text is whatever the admin wrote. Sabi never rewrites it. (Samples live in sample.js.)
//  - "Verified" appears only when a record is truly verified. Notices show their SOURCE ("From SUG").
//  - hand.* is the handwritten line: at most ONE per screen (it is the hero kicker). Keep it short.
//  - Placeholders are {braces}. No em or en dashes. Sentence case. No emoji.
//  - The privacy policy is Sabi's, not FUTA's. The footer always says Sabi is unofficial.
